  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, be a hyperbola such that the sum of lengths of the transverse and the conjugate axes is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>. If the eccentricity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, then value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "88",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>We know&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>88</mn></math></p>",
